# GAP Workflow — La PesquerApp

When the user asks to create, implement or audit a GAP, follow:

- `docs/agent-system/workflows/gap-workflow.md`
- `docs/agent-system/agents/operational-roles.md`
- `docs/agent-system/rules/*.md` relevant to the affected files

## Rules

- Discovery clarifies and documents; it does not implement.
- Implementation follows the confirmed GAP and records deviations.
- Audit verifies acceptance criteria and closes or rejects.
- Active GAP storage remains `.claude/gaps/**` for now.
- Do not touch other `.claude/**` files.
- Do not work outside GAP-listed files without Jose's approval.

## Output

Report the active phase, files inspected, files touched, checks run, risks and
the GAP state.
